odotengine/godot/pull/108114.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-24T16:29:54Z"},"body":"Convenience function to allow resetting all instances on a `MultiMesh` at once, rather than calling individually _per instance_.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* I had been meaning to add this function for a while, there had been several requests to make things easier for bulk resetting.\r\n* The naming is slightly confusing, as we have `MultiMeshInstance` as a scene node, but the `MultiMesh` resource contains instances themselves (which are reset here), but that naming seems to have been set in stone historically and can't easily be changed now.\r\n* An alternative might be to call the functions `reset_all_instances...` rather than `reset_instances...`, given that the current is very similar to `reset_instance...` used already, am happy to change if this is preferred.\r\n* Also applicable in 3.x.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com